      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Recently I have this message too. This message can be reproduced by just walking inside the projectors view in this world as its draw a shadow onto the projection.\n\nwrld_1843fa75-5d87-447d-a08c-87d630e7bec7\n\nUsing the prefab or simply using a Camera as Depth and a Depth Rendertexture with ColorFormat set as \"Depth_AUTO\" causes this problem. Changing Depth_AUTO to something else will fix the message but the results dont work as intended. However the Depth camera still works normally when the message spams your log. (It doesn't spam unity console when testing in Unity)\n\nThere are no other ways to suppress this message (rather disabling Logging) and have the function working. Worlds are created with Unity 2019, I dont know if this is fixed when using Unity 2022 and upload as a 2022 unity world to VRC.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
